# Dynamic Web Portfolio — Task Tracker

## Phase 1: Project Setup & Foundation
- [ ] Initialize Next.js 14 project with App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- [ ] Configure Supabase client utilities (browser, server, middleware)
- [ ] Set up environment variables and `.env.example`
- [ ] Configure `next.config.js`, `tailwind.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`

## Phase 2: Database & Authentication
- [ ] Create SQL migration files (schema, indexes, RLS, functions/triggers, seed data)
- [ ] Generate Supabase TypeScript types (`database.types.ts`)
- [ ] Implement Supabase Auth middleware for token refresh
- [ ] Build admin login page (`/admin/login`)
- [ ] Create auth guard for admin routes

## Phase 3: Public-Facing Pages
- [ ] Build global layout (Navbar, Footer, theme tokens)
- [ ] Home page — hero, featured projects, skills overview, certifications
- [ ] About page — biography, professional summary
- [ ] Projects listing page — filterable/searchable grid
- [ ] Project detail page (`/projects/[slug]`)
- [ ] Contact page

## Phase 4: Admin Dashboard
- [ ] Admin layout (sidebar, header, protected wrapper)
- [ ] Dashboard home — stats cards, recent activity
- [ ] Projects CRUD interface
- [ ] Skills CRUD interface
- [ ] Certifications CRUD interface
- [ ] Achievements CRUD interface
- [ ] Content pages editor
- [ ] Analytics view

## Phase 5: Polish & Documentation
- [ ] Responsive design pass (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- [ ] SEO meta tags and Open Graph support
- [ ] Error boundaries and loading states
- [ ] README.md, DEPLOYMENT.md, DATABASE.md
- [ ] CI/CD workflow (`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`)
- [ ] Final verification and build check
